{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Oh hello there, dearie.</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(WARNING: This game includes flashing that may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a little old lady who needs to clean your big magical cellar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn colorful spells, meet strange NPCs, and uncover the secrets of the dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You die 100s of times and lose your memories in order to learn dark magic. it's cute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876850/extras/sweepsweep2.gif?t=1746602432\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tidy up! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweep away dust, monsters, bugs and more with your trusty broom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn colorful hag magic that changes the rules of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every creature has a unique mechanic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the environment to solve puzzles and find secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free the elders trapped in the crystals. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purify the dungeon, purify the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a Babushka!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your cat ran away! (she's a babushka too)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876850/extras/ezgif-1-40a410c32d.gif?t=1746602432\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Great Grandma!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1876850/76577fb0bfa692583ae89fa7510c8fadb0757dc5.jpg"},{"name":"Ange